# 2026-06-30 · src-tauri/Cargo.lock IS committed for binary apps so CI
# resolves the same crate versions a local build sees. Previously ignored
# (default Cargo Rust-lib template), which let GitHub Actions re-resolve
# the dep tree and pick incompatible cookie/time combos · ship 2.2.6 CI
# failure root cause. Keep it tracked.

